<!--
  The legacy launcher icon's background: the same field with its corners rounded by hand.

  API 24-25 apply no mask of their own, so a square drawable would show as a hard square beside the
  round icons of other apps. The adaptive path uses `ic_launcher_background` instead, because the
  launcher masks that one.
-->
